          "detailed_description": "Colour line-art life chart on a white background. A horizontal time axis labelled \"Year\" with printed ticks 2004, 2005, 2012, 2017, 2019, 2020, 2022, 2023 and 2024 runs left to right at the mid-level; the vertical axis is labelled \"Mood\" with dotted horizontal guide lines at \"mania\", \"hypomania\" and \"depression\". A red bar rises from the axis to the hypomania line at 2005 with the label \"hypomanic episode\". Blue bars descend below the axis to the depression line at 2004 (\"1st depressive episode\"), 2017 (\"2nd depressive episode, suicide attempt\"), 2019 (\"3rd depressive episode, suicide attempt\"), 2022 (\"4th depressive episode\") and 2024 (\"5th depressive episode\"); a shallower blue band follows between episodes and a black X marks each episode, the hypomanic peak and a point labelled \"Retirement\" at 2012. Green outlined up-arrows are labelled \"ECT / Subanesthetic ketamine\" (at 2019) and \"2020~2022 rTMS\" (2020 to 2022). A large green outlined upward arrow labelled \"Intranasal Esketamine Since 2022 October\" rises from the axis, its shaft spanning from just left of the 2023 tick to beyond the 2024 tick. A short red bar above the axis between the 2023 and 2024 ticks, just left of 2024, is labelled \"Buying spree\". There are no panel letters.",
